-- Automatic let-polymorphism
--
-- Every lambda is polymorphic: one binder `id` used at `Int` and at `Type`
-- in the same program.  Each application instantiates the parameter fresh
-- (the runtime's per-apply clones), so no generalize/instantiate form is
-- needed.
-- output: [5, Type]

((id => ((id 5 : Int), (id Type : Type))) (x => x)) : <Int, Type>
